{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":37016909,"ns":0,"title":"Koecher–Vinberg theorem","extract":"In operator algebra, the Koecher–Vinberg theorem is a reconstruction theorem for real Jordan algebras. It was proved independently by Max Koecher in 1957 and Ernest Vinberg in 1961.","description":"Theorem of operator algebra","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}